  "prefLabel": "Bar 102.01 Duties and Responsibilities",
  "priorExpiration": "1998-12-28",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bar 102.01 Duties and Responsibilities. The board shall administer the provisions of RSA 313-A, which include but are not limited to safeguarding life, health, and property, to promoting public welfare and maintaining a high standard of integrity regarding the practice of barbering, cosmetology, esthetics, and manicuring in this state.\n\nSource. #1879, eff 12-3-81; ss by #2539, eff 11-18-83; ss by #4814, eff 5-16-90; ss by #5308, eff 1-16-92; ss by #5544, eff 12-28-92, EXPIRED: 12-28-98\n\nNew. #8223, eff 12-9-04",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/bar100-700.html"
